# Runs whose positions or cell blow up (#168, D225),
# scenario sanitize of Driver/Inputs/python_position_guard.py, under
# compute-sanitizer: a restraint that sends an atom to about 1e190 nm, two
# particles on top of one another with PME, and a barostat that scales the
# cell by about 1e10, each run to its failure and to the end of the part
# that failed, with no access beyond a buffer.
#
# REQUIRES: cuda, compute-sanitizer, python-api
#
# RUN: %compute_sanitizer --tool memcheck --error-exitcode 1 %mdir_python \
# RUN:   %S/../Driver/Inputs/python_position_guard.py %S/../Driver/Inputs/dipeptide GPU sanitize 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: restraint Mixed: fails after step
# CHECK: overlap Mixed: fails after step 0
# CHECK: barostat Mixed: fails after step
# CHECK: position guard sanitize passed
# CHECK: ERROR SUMMARY: 0 errors
